- Software installs queued together can now run at the same time on a host. `POST /api/v1/fleet/hosts/:id/software/install` queues several titles as one batch, installs queued by policy automations from the same policy report share a batch, and the new `install_software_in_parallel` setup experience setting starts every setup experience software item as one batch. The host's queue hands a batch to the agent all at once instead of one install per check-in.
